95             Illinois<BR>Inspection Station<BR>Elk Grove Village, IL<BR>     Passed emissions inspection<BR> <BR>            <BR>            <BR>            <BR>10/18/1995             Illinois<BR>Inspection Station<BR>Elk Grove Village, IL<BR>     Failed emissions inspection<BR> <BR>            <BR>            <BR>            <BR>03/06/2000             Illinois<BR>Motor Vehicle Dept.<BR>El Paso, IL<BR>Title #T0066862007<BR>     Title issued<BR>Exempt from odometer reporting<BR> <BR><P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/tweek.jpg"> ||||reg||1
